:name: @NAME@ on a CH32V203-like RV32IMAC board (Rust, riscv32imac)
:description: ./renode-box renode <dir>/@NAME@/@NAME@_ch32v203.resc after `make`.
$elf?=$ORIGIN/build/target/riscv32imac-unknown-none-elf/release/@NAME@

using sysbus
mach create "@NAME@_ch32v203"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/@NAME@_ch32v203.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
